pacing=\"0em\" rowspacing=\"3pt\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>j</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\"><mo minsize=\"1.623em\" maxsize=\"1.623em\">(</mo></mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>j</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><munder><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">∑</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>k</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></munder><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>k</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\"><mo minsize=\"1.623em\" maxsize=\"1.623em\">)</mo></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>1</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>/</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>j</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>j</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\"><mo minsize=\"1.623em\" maxsize=\"1.623em\">(</mo></mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>j</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><munder><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">∑</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>k</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>k</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\"><mo minsize=\"1.623em\" maxsize=\"1.623em\">)</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace></mstyle><mi>i</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>{#eq-cmp-cholesky}</p>\n<p>and every radicand in it is positive.</p></li>\n<li><p>The computation takes <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\